  "executive_rationale": "A Minnesota nonprofit that sponsored federally funded child-nutrition sites. DOJ proved at trial that sites under its sponsorship claimed to serve thousands of meals within days of forming, and its founder was sentenced to 500 months. Empire Cuisine And Market, registered in April 2020, is a linked site operator in the same pilot seed set. This is public money reaching shells directly.[^S48][^S42]"
